# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
#  "Concrete Jungle" — Jungle / Drum & Bass
#  BeatForge Script Demo Song
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

bpm 170
swing 5
reverb 0.2
delay 0.3

# ── Breakbeat (chopped amen) ─────────────
# Load CHOPS kit first!
# Program amen slices as a breakbeat:

# Classic amen chop pattern:
# Pad 0 (amen1): kick hits
# Pad 1 (amen2): snare hits
# Pad 2 (amen3): ghost notes
# Pad 3-7: fills and variations

# Main break (Bank A):
kick  "x..x....x..x..x."
snare "....x..+....x..."
hh    "x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x."
oh    ".......x........"

# Double-time break (Bank B):
# kick  "x.x.x...x.x.x.x."
# snare "..x...x...x...x."
# hh    "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"

# ── Strudel pattern version ──────────────
# s("kick [snare kick] hh*8 snare").fast(2)
# s("kick(3,8) , snare(2,8) , hh*16")

# ── Sub bass (heavy reese) ──────────────
# Assign synth, use "Reese Bass" preset
note "C1.8 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ C1.4 ~ Eb1.4 ~ F1.8 ~ ~ ~"

# ── Pad (atmospheric) ────────────────────
# Use "Dark Pad" preset, long notes
# C minor chord sustained over 16 steps

# ── Euclidean fills ──────────────────────
euclidean perc 7 16
euclidean rim 5 16

# ── Song structure ───────────────────────
# Bank A: intro — filtered break, building (4 bars)
# Bank B: verse — full speed break + bass (8 bars)
# Bank C: drop — double-time break + bass slides (8 bars)
# Bank D: breakdown — half-time, just pad + sub (4 bars)
# Bank E: second drop — even more intense (8 bars)
# Bank F: outro — break slowing down (4 bars)

# ── Mix ──────────────────────────────────
# This is ALL about the drums
# Breaks: front and center, slight distortion (10%)
# Sub bass: sidechain to kick, heavy
# Pad: way back in the mix, reverb 50%
# Everything: master enhancer 35% for that compressed jungle sound
# Delay: tempo-synced 1/8, feedback high for dubby echoes
